# Hi there, I'm Laurent Lacôte 👋 🇫🇷 🇬🇧

**Technical Product Owner & IT Project Manager** based in Toulouse, France.

### Who am I?
Just one human among others, although I do have a few defining features that may be of interest. :)

#### A swiss tool which expands infinitely (continuous learning is what I do)

One of my core problems as a child was deciding what to do, as the universe seemed far too wide and rich with interesting topics to explore. Although I did finally choose some, I kept and continue keeping a curious soul, always keeping an eye and ear on new technologies, great discoveries or important (geo)political events.

This shaped me over years to be able to quickly grab (mostly) any topic, search "entry points" for it and learn the ropes by myself. Of course, don't expect miracles though: I'm not a rocket scientist, don't ask me to learn how to launch them! 

#### An engine for collaboration and team growth (empowering is what I love)
Being grateful for all ancestors which shared built-up knowledge, being aware that however talented a single human can go so far, I appreciate others sharing their experience and knowledge with me, as I try to do as well at my level. My compounded experiences from academic trainings and professional life gave me a sharp view on how crucial it is to keep up a pro-active and constructive mindset shared by everyone involved in a project to overcome the challenges that inevitably arise.

Having been raised in a family of teachers, I got an interest early in "how to learn" and "how to teach" and try to instill this in all my interactions.
As such, I know which medium, tone and structure to adopt depending on the target audience and content goal, as (obviously) different situations require different approach (ex low-level technical documentation vs high-level roadmap for project holders).


